OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy morning with
OL,6,Foutbreaks of rain and drizzle moving
OL,7,Feastwards. Turning drier later in the
OL,8,Fday with some brighter spells
OL,9,Fdeveloping. Feeling increasingly humid
OL,10,Fas the day progresses. Breezy.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FFurther outbreaks of rain
OL,13,Fspreading eastwards throughout this
OL,14,Fevening, before eastern area turn
OL,15,Flargely dry overnight. A warm and
OL,16,Fhumid night to come, leading to an
OL,17,Funcomfortable night for some.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
