OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FAny overnight rain becoming
OL,6,Frestricted to far west where it will
OL,7,Fremain largely cloudy throughout the
OL,8,Fday. Sunny spells developing elsewhere
OL,9,Fwhich may trigger the odd shower. Warm
OL,10,Fand humid.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FRemaining
OL,13,Fchangeable as rain returns on Friday.
OL,14,FSaturday likely to be dry and bright,
OL,15,Fbut a spell of rain likely overnight.
OL,16,FBright, breezy and potentially warm on
OL,17,FSunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
